WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.228
Many organizations use the CIS Controls as a foundation for security improvement.

2
00:00:05.228 --> 00:00:13.360
By implementing safeguards, reviewing progress, and improving operational practices, organizations can strengthen resilience.

3
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:18.948
The controls help transform security from an abstract concept into actionable activities.

4
00:00:18.948 --> 00:00:24.216
That makes them useful for planning, measurement, communication, and long-term maturity.

5
00:00:24.216 --> 00:00:34.443
A security program can use the controls to identify what matters now, what should come next, and how progress should be communicated to leaders and stakeholders.

6
00:00:34.443 --> 00:00:46.207
The long-term value comes from continuous improvement: choosing priorities, implementing safeguards, reviewing results, and adapting as risks and business needs change.
